{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/keyphrase","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:05.142Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/keyphrase/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/keyphrase/about"},"readme":"## About\n\n[Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services) is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications. Azure AI services contains a broad set of capabilities including text analytics; facial detection, speech and vision recognition; natural language understanding, and more.\n\nContainer support in Azure AI services allow developers to use the same rich APIs that are available in Azure but with the flexibility that comes with containers. See [Container support in Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services-containers) for details.\n\nKeyPhrase is part of [Text Analytics](https://azure.microsoft.com/services/cognitive-services/text-analytics) and can extract the key talking points and highlights in text in either English, German, Spanish, or Japanese.\n\n## Featured tags\n\n- `latest`\ndocker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/keyphrase\n\n## Related repositories\n\n+ [Language Detection](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-textanalytics-language): For up to 120 languages, detects which language the input text is written in and report a single language code for every document submitted on the request.\n+ [Sentiment Analysis](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-textanalytics-sentiment): Analyzes raw text for clues about positive or negative sentiment.\n+ [Azure AI services Images](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services): Azure AI services is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSee the [configuration documentation](https://aka.ms/languageaicontainers) for how to configure this image.\n\n## Usage\n\nSee the [How-to](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018835&clcid=0x409) for how to use this image.\n\nAlso see the [set of samples](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2043312&clcid=0x409) to help getting started with Azure AI services.\n\n## Support\n\nReport feedback or issues on [Stack Overflow](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2056278) using tag azure-cognitive-services.\n\n## License\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\n\nNotice: Copyright © Microsoft Corporation 2020. This Azure AI services Container image is made available to you under the [terms governing your subscription to Microsoft Azure Services](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018657) (including the [Online Services Terms](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018760)). If you do not have a valid Azure subscription, then you may not use this container.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-09T17:46:16.8684863+00:00","categories":["IoT Edge Modules"],"keywords":[],"license":"Other","links":[{"name":"licence","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/licensing/terms/product/ForOnlineServices/EAEAS"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"363K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"3.0","digest":"sha256:0308fce7a3d8d9639a65d775494d685dd08902a451d87ce91dcd06c8dab1329a","pushed":"2026-09-09T17:46:17.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:0308fce7a3d8d9639a65d775494d685dd08902a451d87ce91dcd06c8dab1329a","push